# Text files are LF in the repository AND in every working copy, whatever
# core.autocrlf a machine has. Several tests read source files and match them
# with LF-only patterns (ai-key-preservation, seo-404-beacon,
# variant-gallery-*), and failed on a CRLF checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types: never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
